{"id":"443388","name":"茶树菇排骨汤","author":"厨娘宋宋","authorId":"9823148","desc":"","cover":"images/443388/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"800克"},{"name":"茶树菇","amount":"500克"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"一茶匙"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"三茶匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨用清水浸泡出血水。","img":"images/443388/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"冷水下锅焯水捞出洗净备用。","img":"images/443388/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"排骨倒入砂锅加入清水，葱结，姜片，两茶匙料酒。","img":"images/443388/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"大火烧开煮四十分钟，挑出葱结和姜片。","img":"images/443388/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入洗净的茶树菇。","img":"images/443388/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"大火煮十五分钟，加入盐调味即可。","img":"images/443388/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/443388/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/443388/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}